-2261\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> N.\n<br>C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>MgBr performs substitution reaction with ester -COOCH<sub>3</sub>.\n<br><br>Conjugated dienes (two double bonds separated by a single bond) gives Br water test. Either 1-2 or 1-4 addition can happen.\n<br><br><b>For option (C) :</b>\n<br><br>C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>MgBr reacts with -OH group and creates alkane C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>.\n<br><br>As here C = C present, so this compound gives Br water tests."},"hi":{"content":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन सा यौगिक एथाइलमैग्नीशियम ब्रोमाइड के साथ प्रतिक्रिया करता है और ब्रोमिन पानी के घोल को भी अपरंग करता है:","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/jWQfM152kmbnTcevV/BVqkXAiNELfVkyRWJAFvhyUAYSIqd/w0Zbci8KSayvFgKJtSbaPD/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 11th January Evening Slot Chemistry - Alcohols, Phenols and Ethers Question 147 Hindi Option 1\">"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/XwGYzSY5nX3iaR1eu/JnHItNDDsPadGndjRSGYgpsfmvQbG/pbNxoPjKSo8cxumoTbPqFk/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 11th January Evening Slot Chemistry - Alcohols, Phenols and Ethers Question 147 Hindi Option 2\">"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/psvlYqZ4ZR397ZX7N/KEKsGKWjY9OR5g91sDuEZIC4gdl0Z/f1nAZGQeofbMoq4MObnfK7/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 11th January Evening Slot Chemistry - Alcohols, Phenols and Ethers Question 147 Hindi Option 3\">"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/h40cyAwyUgYebOkXX/uUe9K0XXxri1Hgw6LxAKjCyYaUniN/URtbPXuOvF8CqpGf5TJPbK/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" 